A procedure and an adjacent region are separated by one blank line in
either order, and two regions in a row likewise (fmt.blank_lines_between_procs:
"any of the four pairings"). Region bodies stay verbatim.
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE First;
:RETURN 1;
:ENDPROC;
:REGION Payload;
raw text
:ENDREGION;
:REGION Second;
more raw text
:ENDREGION;


:PROCEDURE Last;
:RETURN 2;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE First;
	:RETURN 1;
:ENDPROC;

:REGION Payload;
raw text
:ENDREGION;

:REGION Second;
more raw text
:ENDREGION;

:PROCEDURE Last;
	:RETURN 2;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
